#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:191
msgid "Magfit WebTools Utilty"
msgstr "Magfit WebTools 工具"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:5
#: bedbdc84a49f4223844e48a66bd0c888
msgid "Advanced Compass Setup"
msgstr "高级罗盘设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:7
#: 6553c03029fb4e2ba73539ed449fa891
msgid ""
"This article provides advanced guidance for how to setup the system "
"compass(es) and advanced compass related features."
msgstr "本文为如何设置系统罗盘及高级罗盘相关功能提供高级指导。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:11
#: 880b5e739886483c99ca53a3d554b7a1
msgid ""
"Users who have only internal compasses or an external compass using a UBlox "
"GPS + compass combination,such as :ref:`UBlox GPS + Compass Module <common-"
"installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module>`, and have mounted it in the "
"default orientation can usually perform a simple \"Onboard Calibration\" as "
"described in :ref:`Compass Calibration <common-compass-calibration-in-"
"mission-planner>`)."
msgstr ""
"仅使用内部罗盘或使用 UBlox GPS + 罗盘组合的外置罗盘（例如 :ref:`UBlox GPS + Compass Module "
"<common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-"
"module>`）且按默认方向安装的用户，通常只需执行简单的「机载校准」，如 :ref:`Compass Calibration <common-"
"compass-calibration-in-mission-planner>`) 中所述。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:14
#: ca7dafdb00b64ae5abc3289a38a0d1d2
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:16
#: d96776d91c354eb2bf732d827c3b8ab3
msgid ""
"Accurately setting up the compass is critical because it is the primary "
"source of heading information. Without an accurate heading the vehicle will "
"not move in the correct direction in autopilot modes (i.e. AUTO, LOITER, "
"PosHold, RTL, etc). This can lead to circling (aka \"toiletbowling\") or "
"fly-aways."
msgstr ""
"准确设置罗盘至关重要，因为它是航向信息的主要来源。如果航向不准确，飞行器在飞控模式下（即 AUTO、LOITER、PosHold、RTL "
"等）将无法朝正确方向移动。这可能导致绕圈（俗称「马桶效应」）或飞走。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:22
#: 96678993da6d483da25ceeb9c45754ed
msgid ""
"ArduPilot allows multiple compasses to be connected, but only three are used"
" at one time. And usually, only the primary compass is used, unless there "
"are consistency problems with its readings versus other compasses and/or "
"other sensors. In this case, the autopilot will automatically determine "
"which of the first three compasses to use."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot "
"允许连接多个罗盘，但一次只使用三个。通常只使用主罗盘，除非其读数与其他罗盘和/或其他传感器存在一致性问题。在这种情况下，飞控将自动确定使用前三个罗盘中的哪一个。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:24
#: 8b4f7d81111d4f34a7769c53ecbd63b8
msgid ""
"While many autopilots have an internal compass or compasses, many "
"applications will instead use an external compass. This provides more "
"reliable data than an internal compass because of the separation from other "
"electronics. See :ref:`common-autopilots` for details about the specific "
"autopilot to determine how many built-in compasses the autopilot may have, "
"if any."
msgstr ""
"虽然许多飞控具有内置罗盘，但许多应用会使用外置罗盘。由于与其他电子设备的距离较远，外置罗盘提供的数据比内置罗盘更可靠。有关特定飞控内置罗盘数量的详细信息，请参阅"
" :ref:`common-autopilots`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:28
#: 8356b92a936f46a39a38e84efd70977a
msgid ""
"Most users will only need to  perform the normal :ref:`Compass "
"Calibration<common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner>` but details are "
"also given on the less-used  :ref:`CompassMot <common-compass-setup-"
"advanced_compassmot_compensation_for_interference_from_the_power_wires_escs_and_motors>`"
msgstr ""
"大多数用户只需执行常规 :ref:`Compass Calibration<common-compass-calibration-in-mission-"
"planner>`，但也会提供较少使用的 :ref:`CompassMot <common-compass-setup-"
"advanced_compassmot_compensation_for_interference_from_the_power_wires_escs_and_motors>`"
" 的详细信息"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:32
#: eee8b55580f047eaa0e8c94f528abdfa
msgid "Compass Settings"
msgstr "罗盘设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:34
#: 0fc02bfd5d094e7b9e06d965420c5e28
msgid ""
"The *Mission Planner Compass Setup screen* can be found in menu **Setup \\| "
"Mandatory Hardware \\| Compass** in the sidebar. This screen is used for "
"setting compass ordering, priority, calibration, and use. No other settings "
"are required for normal use."
msgstr ""
"*Mission Planner 罗盘设置界面* 可在侧边栏菜单 **Setup \\| Mandatory Hardware \\| "
"Compass** 中找到。此界面用于设置罗盘排序、优先级、校准和使用。正常使用不需要其他设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:41
#: f33315d7c015456f81d05975f7afc52d
msgid "Mission Planner: Advanced Compass Setup and Calibration"
msgstr "Mission Planner：高级罗盘设置与校准"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:45
#: ccd8c53c611d49f0b842535a0c7614fd
msgid "Compass Ordering and Priority"
msgstr "罗盘排序与优先级"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:47
#: 89d2dfb99e944e0da1d61aab634f6cf4
msgid ""
"During boot, ArduPilot automatically detects the compasses present in the "
"system, adds them to a list, and assigns the first three a priority (1-3) "
"linked to their DEV ID (``COMPASS_PRIOx_ID``), according to the order in "
"which they are discovered. This priority determines which compass is used by"
" the EKF lanes. The primary compass (highest priority, 1) will be used by "
"all lanes, and fallback to the next viable compass in the first three "
"priorities, if the primary becomes unhealthy."
msgstr ""
"启动时，ArduPilot 会自动检测系统中存在的罗盘，将其添加到列表中，并根据发现顺序为前三个罗盘分配优先级（1-3），并通过其设备 "
"ID（``COMPASS_PRIOx_ID``）进行关联。此优先级决定了 EKF "
"通道使用哪个罗盘。主罗盘（最高优先级，1）将被所有通道使用，如果主罗盘不健康，则回退到前三个优先级中下一个可用的罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:49
#: dd3bd77ab82f47eb992c8e95eeccfa7b
msgid ""
"The list of discovered compasses and their priority is maintained across "
"boots."
msgstr "已发现罗盘的列表及其优先级在重启后保持不变。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:51
#: ac1fd7b7b2fb4120a24a20e2d4fbcd2e
msgid ""
"If a user wishes to change to a different compass for one of the three "
"priorities, he can change the ``COMPASS_PRIOx_ID`` to that compass's "
"``COMPASS_DEV_IDx`` ID value. If a ``COMPASS_PRIOx_ID`` is set to zero, the "
"compasses will be moved up contiguously, in order, to fill that priority "
"slot on the next reboot. This is easily done in Mission Planner with the "
"arrows on the right side."
msgstr ""
"如果用户希望将某个优先级更改为不同的罗盘，可以将 ``COMPASS_PRIOx_ID`` 更改为该罗盘的 ``COMPASS_DEV_IDx`` ID"
" 值。如果将 ``COMPASS_PRIOx_ID`` 设置为零，则罗盘将在下次重启时按顺序连续向上填充该优先级位置。在 Mission Planner"
" 中，通过右侧的箭头可以轻松完成此操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:53
#: 85342d2a5fc149e9b98f6b839b198047
msgid ""
"never change a compass's ``COMPASS_DEV_IDx`` ID value manually and then "
"reboot!"
msgstr "切勿手动更改罗盘的 ``COMPASS_DEV_IDx`` ID 值后重启！"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:55
#: d3c50cbf85744ce2abc2ce9994aecf9a
msgid ""
"If a previously discovered compass is missing or not detected on boot, and "
"is in one of the three priority positions, a pre-arm failure will occur "
"warning the user. The user will need to either remove the compass from the "
"priority position, or correct the problem in order to prevent the pre-arm "
"failure. Mission Planner provides a button to remove an undetected compass "
"on the above screen."
msgstr ""
"如果之前发现的罗盘在启动时缺失或未被检测到，且处于三个优先级位置之一，则会发生预解锁失败，警告用户。用户需要从优先级位置中移除该罗盘，或纠正问题以防止预解锁失败。Mission"
" Planner 在上述界面提供了删除未检测到罗盘的按钮。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:57
#: 32a378f817e64770ad3423355c9f9b56
msgid ""
"Compasses not present or detected during a calibration will automatically be"
" removed."
msgstr "在校准过程中未出现或未被检测到的罗盘将被自动移除。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:60
#: b8285db12f044143ab21c8f7ca9d7288
msgid "Compass Enables"
msgstr "罗盘启用"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:62
#: 4ba5083e4d384516aada401bd563f5bb
msgid ""
"Any one of the first three compasses can be disabled. This would leave only "
"the remaining ones to be used by the autopilot. You may wish to disable any "
"internal compasses if you are consistently seeing the “inconsistent "
"compasses” pre-arm message often and you are sure that the external compass "
"is calibrated."
msgstr ""
"前三个罗盘中的任意一个都可以被禁用。这将只留下其余罗盘供飞控使用。如果您经常看到「罗盘不一致」的预解锁提示，并且确定外置罗盘已校准，则可以考虑禁用所有内置罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:66
#: f337366080904824abad02f1aeea7a21
msgid ""
"Compasses should always be enabled for Copter/Rover, but may be disabled "
"(not recommended, if one is available) for Plane."
msgstr "对于旋翼机/漫游车，罗盘应始终启用，但对于飞机可以禁用（如果有罗盘，不建议禁用）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:69
#: ca0d92504b9e40e4bd4b076be1bd33ab
msgid "Orientation"
msgstr "方向"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:71
#: 1b396017adec40f78c1efec3ac545cdd
msgid ""
"The :ref:`AHRS_ORIENTATION<AHRS_ORIENTATION>` must be set correctly for the "
"compass calibration to be successful. In addition,the :ref:`common-"
"accelerometer-calibration` should be completed before the Compass "
"Calibration."
msgstr ""
"必须正确设置 :ref:`AHRS_ORIENTATION<AHRS_ORIENTATION>`，才能成功进行罗盘校准。此外，应在罗盘校准之前完成 "
":ref:`common-accelerometer-calibration`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:73
#: 799cd768120d42ef902cc5bc1a96f2ba
msgid ""
"The setting of the orientation of external compasses is no longer required. "
"It's determined automatically during :ref:`common-compass-calibration-in-"
"mission-planner` now. This can be disabled, or only report the orientation "
"determined during Compass Calibration, using the "
":ref:`COMPASS_AUTO_ROT<COMPASS_AUTO_ROT>` parameter. The orientation "
"determination CAN fail if the magnetic fields are compromised by nearby "
"metal or other interference, especially on 45 deg offset orientations. If "
"the compass is known to be mounted on a 45 degree bias to the "
"accelerometers, and fails to determine orientation during the Compass "
"Calibration, then setting :ref:`COMPASS_AUTO_ROT<COMPASS_AUTO_ROT>` to \"3\""
" and repeating the calibration, may yield a successful completion."
msgstr ""
"现在不再需要手动设置外置罗盘的方向，它会在 :ref:`common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner` "
"期间自动确定。可以使用 :ref:`COMPASS_AUTO_ROT<COMPASS_AUTO_ROT>` "
"参数禁用此功能，或仅报告罗盘校准期间确定的方向。如果附近有金属或其他干扰，尤其是在 45 度偏移方向上，方向确定可能失败。如果已知罗盘相对于加速度计以 "
"45 度偏置安装，且在罗盘校准期间无法确定方向，则将 :ref:`COMPASS_AUTO_ROT<COMPASS_AUTO_ROT>` "
"设置为「3」并重复校准可能会成功完成。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:75
#: 24f6d2caad7340a387f1070c5c036d45
msgid ""
"automatic determination of compass orientation ONLY occurs using normal "
"Compass Calibration. :ref:`In-flight Calibration<automatic-compass-offset-"
"calibration>` and :ref:`Large Vehicle Mag Calibration <large-vehicle-mag-"
"cal>` require that the orientation be properly set BEFORE attempting these "
"types of calibration."
msgstr ""
"罗盘方向的自动确定仅在正常罗盘校准时发生。:ref:`飞行中校准<automatic-compass-offset-calibration>` 和 "
":ref:`大型飞行器磁校准 <large-vehicle-mag-cal>` 要求在尝试这些类型的校准之前正确设置方向。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:77
#: f6716bf02cec42689d884eac9276c008
msgid ""
"However, if the need to double-check the orientation of a compass should "
"arise:"
msgstr "但是，如果需要再次检查罗盘方向："

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:79
#: 0f88272ad7c641cd8f65814620663c2c
msgid ""
"When rotating your aircraft through all axes each of the compasses should "
"move in the same direction, and should be of approximately the same values:"
msgstr "当您将飞行器在所有轴上旋转时，每个罗盘应沿相同方向移动，且数值应大致相同："

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:84
#: 612ba6df55ff4a9aabe842425a80f308
msgid "Northern Hemisphere:"
msgstr "北半球："

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:82
#: 6139964b004b41149070dcce004a61fd
msgid "Z-component should be *positive*"
msgstr "Z 分量应为 *正值*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:83
#: f276f4d4a5684b668b5253019df62af7
msgid ""
"when pitching the vehicle down, the X component should *increase* in value"
msgstr "当飞行器向下俯仰时，X 分量应 *增大*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:84
#: 1a987eea88504814a71e5f0efd7aff95
msgid ""
"when rolling the vehicle right, the Y component should *increase* in value"
msgstr "当飞行器向右横滚时，Y 分量应 *增大*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:89
#: e7b3b8844deb4e57981dca49a8ff5533
msgid "Southern Hemisphere:"
msgstr "南半球："

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:87
#: 8b5278d6f9f949a6bc2c87b379ffc348
msgid "Z-component should be *negative*"
msgstr "Z 分量应为 *负值*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:88
#: 07813bc676e244fbb80915f39db2ca7b
msgid ""
"when pitching the vehicle down, the X component should *decrease* in value"
msgstr "当飞行器向下俯仰时，X 分量应 *减小*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:89
#: ab3711ab91fa46f6bcbc2dceecf9563f
msgid ""
"when rolling the vehicle right, the Y component should *decrease* in value"
msgstr "当飞行器向右横滚时，Y 分量应 *减小*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:92
#: e40a2785475f4ae6b622637ef4e329bd
msgid "Other parameters"
msgstr "其他参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:94
#: 7b95c3f6353647afb0716d69c5841a79
msgid ""
"Earlier versions of ArduPilot did not incorporate the world magnetic model "
"database, and a locations magnetic declination might need to manually "
"entered, or learned through flight. This is not necessary now. In addition, "
"this allows the declination to be continuously updated on long distance "
"flights."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot "
"的早期版本未包含世界磁场模型数据库，某地点的磁偏角可能需要手动输入或通过飞行学习。现在已不再需要此操作。此外，这还允许在长途飞行中持续更新磁偏角。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:96
#: f8c26de76f954d44bcfdedd24c897c54
msgid ""
"Also, learning the compass offsets in flight, instead of ground calibration,"
" is an option for vehicles difficult to move in order to calibrate. But is "
"not recommended, since the Large Vehicle MagCal option is now available. See"
" :ref:`common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner` page for details."
msgstr ""
"此外，在飞行中学习罗盘偏移量（而不是地面校准）是难以移动以进行校准的飞行器的一个选项。但不建议使用，因为大型飞行器 MagCal "
"选项现在已可用。有关详细信息，请参阅 :ref:`common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner` 页面。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:102
#: 921997d11a93450884f387ae6da67f40
msgid ""
"CompassMot — compensation for interference from the power wires, ESCs and "
"motors"
msgstr "CompassMot — 补偿电源线、ESC 和电机的干扰"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:104
#: ba14edf6ad984bb7b7368fa9123b22fc
msgid ""
"This is recommended for vehicles that have only an internal compass and on "
"vehicles where there is significant interference on the compass from the "
"motors, power wires, etc. CompassMot only works well if you have a "
":ref:`battery current monitor <common-powermodule-landingpage>` because the "
"magnetic interference is linear with current drawn.  It is technically "
"possible to set-up CompassMot using throttle but this is not recommended."
msgstr ""
"建议在仅有内置罗盘的飞行器以及电机、电源线等对罗盘干扰较大的飞行器上使用此功能。CompassMot 仅在您有 :ref:`电池电流监测器 "
"<common-powermodule-landingpage>` 时效果良好，因为磁干扰与电流成线性关系。从技术上讲，可以使用油门设置 "
"CompassMot，但不建议这样做。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:112
#: a3aad180e440402db4f32881557f0d81
msgid "Please follow these instructions:"
msgstr "请按照以下说明操作："

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:114
#: 7e1fa37516214a7dbe42d98b70f55c6b
msgid ""
"Enable the current monitor (aka :ref:`Power Module <common-powermodule-"
"landingpage>`)"
msgstr "启用电流监测器（即 :ref:`电源模块 <common-powermodule-landingpage>`）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:115
#: 2dd2868953a144c49cfcf54163e29a51
msgid ""
"Disconnect your props, flip them over and rotate them one position around "
"the frame.  In this configuration they should push the copter down into the "
"ground when the throttle is raised"
msgstr "拆下螺旋桨，翻转并在机架上旋转一个位置。在这种配置下，当油门升高时，螺旋桨应将飞行器向下推向地面"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:118
#: deb43210122e45b1b75fba32451b91d1
msgid "Secure the copter (perhaps with tape) so that it does not move"
msgstr "固定飞行器（可以用胶带），使其不会移动"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:119
#: ba265365ee6c49418ef812338223389f
msgid "Turn on your transmitter and keep throttle at zero"
msgstr "打开遥控器，保持油门为零"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:120
#: 677814cd043e435d865bab387699f591
msgid "Connect your vehicle's LiPo battery"
msgstr "连接飞行器的 LiPo 电池"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:121
#: 29f0463f2a9c419697b746348a2a554c
msgid "Connect your autopilot to your computer with the usb cable"
msgstr "使用 USB 线缆将飞控连接到计算机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:122
#: cdc93b1fb045453985e6f2d420c19f2b
msgid ""
"Open the **Initial Setup \\| Optional Hardware \\| Compass/Motor Calib** "
"screen"
msgstr "打开 **Initial Setup \\| Optional Hardware \\| Compass/Motor Calib** 界面"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:123
#: e079bb443f0e4174896c2dc4051d7886
msgid "Press the **Start** button"
msgstr "按 **Start** 按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:128
#: 5566afcf3e5349db98481dae10ba9fa8
msgid "You should hear your ESCs arming beep"
msgstr "您应该听到 ESC 解锁蜂鸣声"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:129
#: 1629bb3470dd4febaccd587f5707e033
msgid ""
"Raise the throttle slowly to between 50% ~ 75% (the props will spin!) for 5 "
"~ 10 seconds"
msgstr "缓慢将油门提高到 50%～75%（螺旋桨会旋转！），持续 5～10 秒"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:131
#: 2ace9fcce1774d86aba068769087f79a
msgid "Quickly bring the throttle back down to zero"
msgstr "迅速将油门降回零"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:132
#: f8f51a1bf60a4183a6ea169080de4157
msgid "Press the **Finish** button to complete the calibration"
msgstr "按 **Finish** 按钮完成校准"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:133
#: c40faa52df594ba092c6c79ca2ea058f
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Check the % of interference displayed.  If it is less than 30% then your "
"compass interference is acceptable and you should see good Loiter, RTL and "
"AUTO performance.  If it is 31% ~ 60% then the interference is in the \"grey"
" zone\" where it may be ok (some users are fine, some are not).  If it is "
"higher than 60% you should try moving your autopilot further up and away "
"from the sources of interference or consider purchasing an external compass "
"(or :ref:`GPS+compass module<common-positioning-landing-page>` (some of "
"these))."
msgstr ""
"检查显示的干扰百分比。如果小于 30%，则罗盘干扰可以接受，您应该会看到良好的 Loiter、RTL 和 AUTO 性能。如果为 "
"31%～60%，则干扰处于「灰色地带」，可能没问题（部分用户没问题，部分有问题）。如果高于 "
"60%，您应该尝试将飞控移得更高且远离干扰源，或考虑购买外置罗盘（或 :ref:`GPS+罗盘模块<common-positioning-"
"landing-page>`（其中一些））。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:148
#: 1f94121001854bf5977de83d8926b7fe
msgid "Automatic Offset Calibration"
msgstr "自动偏移校准"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:150
#: 13f55b2b88dd4e65bc071e9f04307e95
msgid ""
"DO NOT USE THIS WITH GPS-DERIVED YAW! ie :ref:`common-gps-for-yaw` in  "
"firmware versions before 4.5.2!"
msgstr "请勿在 4.5.2 之前的固件版本中与 GPS 衍生偏航（即 :ref:`common-gps-for-yaw`）一起使用！"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:152
#: 7d3e4ef800854962986c9fbcced54d64
msgid ""
"In the 4.0 and later releases of ArduPilot, an automatic offset learning "
"feature is available. The :ref:`COMPASS_LEARN<COMPASS_LEARN>` parameter "
"determines how this feature works. This is for advanced users and not "
"recommended."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot 4.0 及更高版本中，提供了自动偏移学习功能。:ref:`COMPASS_LEARN<COMPASS_LEARN>` "
"参数决定此功能的工作方式。这适用于高级用户，不建议一般用户使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:154
#: 9360d341e4c74dcc9c09f4670247874f
msgid ""
"If set to 3, the offsets will be learned automatically during flight, be "
"saved, and this parameter reset to 0. Position control modes (Loiter, Auto, "
"etc.) should not be used while the offsets are being learned."
msgstr ""
"如果设置为 3，偏移量将在飞行过程中自动学习，保存后该参数重置为 0。在学习偏移量期间，不应使用位置控制模式（Loiter、Auto 等）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:156
#: 5cd810b1d54c47098f27cb451ba79fb6
msgid ""
"Setting :ref:`COMPASS_LEARN<COMPASS_LEARN>` to 1 or 2 is not recommended. "
"These modes are deprecated and are either non-functional, or still in "
"development."
msgstr ""
"不建议将 :ref:`COMPASS_LEARN<COMPASS_LEARN>` 设置为 1 或 2。这些模式已弃用，要么无功能，要么仍在开发中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:158
#: 15d5a5c682f241d7a2b65f252006b486
msgid "The procedure for :ref:`COMPASS_LEARN<COMPASS_LEARN>` = 3 is:"
msgstr ":ref:`COMPASS_LEARN<COMPASS_LEARN>` = 3 的程序为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:160
#: 8a509f64f2d14a73a6396d2bba3245b7
msgid ""
"set :ref:`COMPASS_LEARN<COMPASS_LEARN>` = 3. The message “CompassLearn: "
"Initialised” will appear on the MP’s message tab (it does not appear in red "
"letters on the HUD)."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`COMPASS_LEARN<COMPASS_LEARN>` 设置为 3。Mission Planner "
"的消息选项卡上将出现「CompassLearn: Initialised」消息（不以红色字母显示在 HUD 上）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:161
#: ae0c7fbac9374c0ca3035d404ddfc317
msgid ""
"“Bad Compass” will appear but this is nothing to be worried about. We will "
"hopefully make this disappear before the final release."
msgstr "「Bad Compass」将会出现，但无需担心。我们希望在最终发布之前使其消失。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:162
#: ff9e51e793744578875799584fa43c33
msgid ""
"Arm and drive/fly the vehicle around in whatever mode you like, do some "
"turns “CompassLearn: have earth field” should appear on MP’s message tab and"
" then eventually “CompassLearn: finished”."
msgstr ""
"解锁并以任意模式驾驶/飞行飞行器，进行一些转弯，「CompassLearn: have earth field」应出现在 Mission Planner"
" 的消息选项卡上，最终显示「CompassLearn: finished」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:164
#: fab2192f7b354e94ad1211bade2967d6
msgid ""
"You MUST have a GPS lock and signal for this to be successful. Be sure the "
"GPS has a clear \"view\" of the sky and there are no obstructions blocking "
"the GPS signals."
msgstr "要成功完成此操作，必须有 GPS 锁定和信号。确保 GPS 对天空有清晰的「视野」，没有遮挡物阻挡 GPS 信号。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:166
#: a8a4908b61f841df86655a832ec7f601
msgid ""
"If you want you can check the :ref:`COMPASS_LEARN<COMPASS_LEARN>` parameter "
"has been set back to zero (you may need to refresh parameters to see this) "
"and the COMPASS_OFS_X/Y/Z values will have changed."
msgstr ""
"如果需要，您可以检查 :ref:`COMPASS_LEARN<COMPASS_LEARN>` 参数是否已重置为零（您可能需要刷新参数才能看到），并且 "
"COMPASS_OFS_X/Y/Z 的值将会改变。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:167
#: 7b8e3180ea104188858f72f426ec01eb
msgid ""
"This method can also be evoked using the RCxOPTION for \"Compass Learn\". It"
" will activate when the channel goes above 1800uS and automatically complete"
" and save."
msgstr "此方法也可以使用「Compass Learn」的 RCxOPTION 触发。当通道值超过 1800uS 时激活，并自动完成和保存。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:172
#: 387c96e1a45c4b508975542fa3c74871
msgid "Compass error messages"
msgstr "罗盘错误消息"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:174
#: 27e4cf6cff8f422a875ba7b730e944aa
msgid ""
"**Compass Health**: The compass has not sent a signal for at least half a "
"second."
msgstr "**Compass Health**：罗盘至少半秒未发送信号。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:176
#: c6936d447d774733a6172456adea5809
msgid ""
"**Compass Variance**: In the EKF solution, compass heading disagrees with "
"the heading estimate from other inertial sensors. Clicking the EKF button on"
" the Mission Planner HUD will show the magnitude of the error."
msgstr ""
"**Compass Variance**：在 EKF 解算中，罗盘航向与其他惯性传感器估计的航向不一致。单击 Mission Planner HUD "
"上的 EKF 按钮将显示误差大小。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:180
#: fddc69666bb340b78e1f9071817feeba
msgid "**Compass Not Calibrated**: The compass needs to be calibrated."
msgstr "**Compass Not Calibrated**：罗盘需要进行校准。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:181
#: 156c98cf3c864defb8d0f29889de0278
msgid ""
"**Compass Offsets High**: One of your compass offsets exceeds 600, "
"indicating likely magnetic interference. Check for sources of interference "
"and try calibrating again."
msgstr "**Compass Offsets High**：您的某个罗盘偏移量超过 600，表明可能存在磁干扰。请检查干扰源并尝试重新校准。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:186
#: 1d00f00567f64eac83ab32ba7e71830b
msgid "Refining Calibration Parameters using a Flight Log"
msgstr "使用飞行日志优化校准参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:188
#: 1d3e9d024e4944b2849ccb5026ef7e44
msgid ""
"The compass offsets, scales, diagonals, and even motor compensation can be "
"determined from a flight dataflash log of the vehicle using an analysis "
"utility."
msgstr "可以使用分析工具从飞行器的飞行数据日志中确定罗盘偏移量、缩放比例、对角线值，甚至电机补偿。"
